From 2ecad233178bfbba9c584ffd9f67e941d84adbb7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sugar Glider <rodrigo.garcia@espressif.com>
Date: Fri, 22 May 2026 05:55:45 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix(hwcdc): fix glitches in writing (#12606)

Backport to Arduino-ESP32 3.3.3: adjust the removed debug-comment
context from TX:%lu to TX:%u. No functional upstream changes.

* fix(hwcdc): fix glitches in writing

* fix(hw_cdc): atomic operation for stashed data

* fix(hw_cdc): potential dead lock when TX buffer is full

* fix(hw_cdc): fixes ISR runing critical-section in FreeRTOS
